@prefix : <http://example.org/x#> .
@prefix dec: <http://w3id.org/conjectures/> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
# Conjectural world: receives reality (and shared), infers locally, does not permeate back.
:S { :A rdfs:subClassOf :B . } :S a dec:sharedWorld .
:x a :A .
:C { :A rdfs:subClassOf :Z . }
:dora :supposes :C . :supposes a dec:conjecturalPredicate .
